window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They told me not to get involved with him because he had a bad reputation. I didn’t listen.</p> <p>Why? Maybe it was those eyes. Most probably it was his body. Or maybe it was his quick wit, easy charm, and the way he made me feel so at ease - like I was perfect just the way I am, flaws and all.</p> <p>I realize now that he wanted me to feel that way, so I’d accept him, just the way he was.</p> <p>He wanted to have his cake and eat it too. He wanted a game, so I gave him one.</p> <p>Checkmate.</p>"; 
